  "description": "During his school days, Seojin developed an interest in Seung-Woo, who would stare at him with a completely expressionless face. When he starts to perceive Seung-Woo's gaze toward him, he realized that it was because of him that Seung-Woo would start to show small glimpses of emotions on his usually blank face. And with this, both of them would start to feel satisfaction when being with each other, which leads Seojin to stay by Seung-Woo's side as his friend. \n\nBut one day, when Seung-Woo starts to become distant toward Seojin, he starts to find himself feeling bothered by his actions and decides to find out the reason behind it... \n\n*Note: The chapter count includes 2 extra chapters.*",
